 "tr_note": "The Textus Receptus adds ταῦτα, 'these things', after 'hearing', which gives the KJV's 'when Jesus heard these things'. It also lacks the article before 'heavens' and reads the singular οὐρανῷ, 'heaven', as the KJV's 'in heaven' does."
